## 1. Project Overview – “Arena Advance” (working name)

**Core concept:**
Real-time PvP arena game (Clash Royale–style) where players:

* Battle in 2–4 minute matches using small decks and elixir.
* Progress through arenas, unlock cards, cosmetics, and modes.
* Use **Advance Challenges** (your “loan” system) to unlock premium content early.
* Get **AI-powered coaching, matchmaking, and advice** to keep the game sweaty, fair, and sticky.

